  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrots, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped pears, chickpeas, vegetable broth, and dried thyme, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the coconut cream and continue to simmer, uncovered, for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Season the tagine to taste with salt and pepper.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
